My leg began to feel strange after playing three straight games. 
I initially assumed it was simply typical muscular discomfort. 
However, the stiffness and agony worsened a few hours later.
I continued to stretch by myself in the team room, wondering whether my muscle was going to burst.
I eventually dragged myself to the medical area, where I received a hot compress for the first time, so hot that it nearly made me giggle.
